Changelog v0.5.3 -> v0.5.4:
- 02b5b17 (Anthony, 2026-07-12): fix: transfer steps (#87)

- 9218f54 (dependabot[bot], 2026-04-25): chore(deps): bump openssl from 0.10.68 to 0.10.78 (#77)
    Bumps [openssl](https://github.com/rust-openssl/rust-openssl) from 0.10.68 to 0.10.78.
    - [Release notes](https://github.com/rust-openssl/rust-openssl/releases)
    - [Commits](https://github.com/rust-openssl/rust-openssl/compare/openssl-v0.10.68...openssl-v0.10.78)
    
    ---
    updated-dependencies:
    - dependency-name: openssl
      dependency-version: 0.10.78
      dependency-type: indirect
    ...
    
    Signed-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>
    Co-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
- 42cc29b (Johann Taberlet, 2026-04-15): feat: add transactions export command (#74)
    * feat: add transactions export command
    
    Add a new `transactions` subcommand to export account transactions
    over a date range using BoursoBank's CSV export endpoint.
    
    - Add `Transaction` struct to `bourso_api::account`
    - Add `get_transactions()` method on `BoursoWebClient`
    - Handle redirect to `api.boursobank.com` for file download
    - Parse BoursoBank CSV (semicolon-separated, French number format)
    - Support CSV (default) and JSON output formats
    - Add unit tests for CSV parsing and amount conversion
    
    * refactor: restructure CLI per maintainer feedback
    
    - Move `transactions` under new `export` subcommand (`bourso export transactions`)
    - Rename `--from`/`--to` to `--start-date`/`--end-date`
    - Rename `--output` (format) to `--format`/`-f`
    - Add `--output`/`-o` for file output path (defaults to stdout)
Pour rebaser le patch sur ce tag et reinstaller:
  ./2_bourso_cli_update.sh --pull        # rebase myqtm sur le tag + build + install
  cd external/bourso-api && git push origin myqtm --force-with-lease && cd -
  git add external/bourso-api && git commit -m 'chore: bump bourso-cli v0.5.4'

